      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَخْلَةٌ مِئْخَارٌ</span></b>  <i>A palm-tree of which the fruit
remains until the end of winter:</i> (AHn, K:) and
<i>until the end of the time of cutting off the fruit
of palm-trees:</i> (S, M, K:) <i>contr. of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِبْكَارٌ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَكُورٌ</span>: pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَآخِيرُ</span>. (A.)

